{
  "rulesetId": "bindery-sim-variant-roster",
  "provenance": "Roster variant of the hand-authored approximate fixture bindery-sim-approx, for testing adaptation to a changed unit roster (a mod). Changes: MTNK renamed GTNK (Allied Guardian Tank, cost 700 to 750); HTK (flak track) and V3 (V3 launcher) removed; E2 re-costed 100 to 200, HTNK 900 to 1100, FV 500 to 650; TNKD (Allied Tank Destroyer, anti-armour vehicle, 900, needs GAWEAP and GAAIRC) added. Build time = max(2, cost * 0.06). Illustrative, NOT retail-accurate. Every structure lists its construction yard and every infantry type its barracks as a prerequisite, standing in for RA2's implicit producing factory; the Rocketeer (E3) and Flak Track (HTK) are dual-purpose (an anti-infantry ground weapon with the anti-air flag), as in RA2. Service depots declare repairs and factories the queues they produce for, as in the base fixture.",
